{"version":1,"content":"<p>【GG ... 😆】圖庫巨頭 Getty Images 今日 (21 日) 正式向特拉華州破產法院申請美國《破產法》第 11 章（Chapter 11）破產保護。</p><p>該公司目前正面對沉重的債務負擔，以及生成式人工智能（Generative AI）技術帶來的強烈衝擊。</p><p>由於其股價持續下挫至 1 美元以下，紐約證券交易所（NYSE）已決定將其除牌，重組後現有普通股股東預計將無法獲得實質補償。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:02:12.271208+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:51:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:17:59.726295+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:58:05.162446+00:00","content_hash":"8bb8e6819a7ee53cc4a404d137f2bcaf453f1eb2922d2ee93d583aeea0eaa6af","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}